## Information Mavis needs

For each pupil, you must include the following information. If any of it is missing, Mavis will not upload the spreadsheet.

- Legal Forename
- Legal Surname
- Date of Birth

## Important information for the vaccination team

Include details for at least one parent wherever possible.

The vaccination team needs parent contact details to request consent for a child’s vaccinations.

The word ‘parent’ refers to anyone who has the legal right to consent to a child’s vaccination.

Mavis needs the child’s postcode to help match them to their NHS record.

- Priority 1 Contact Name
- Priority 1 Contact Telephone
- Priority 1 Contact Email
- Postcode

## Other information you can include

Including this information helps provide a more complete record for each pupil and can help you organise pupils for vaccination sessions.

- Preferred Forename
- Gender
- Address Line 1
- Address Line 2
- Town
- Year Group
- Registration Group
- Priority 2 Contact Name
- Priority 2 Contact Telephone
- Priority 2 Contact Email
